- Disembarking (onFoot false→true): prev='surface' → source.clear() ✓ (prevents the leak of flight → on-foot).
- Re-entering (onFoot true→false): prev='surface' → source.clear() ✓ (prevents the leak of on-foot → ship, e.g. 'w' thrust launching the ship).

